### Ping
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start workflow
POST {{baseUrl}}/internal/workflows/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trip_id": "{{tripId}}",
  "triggered_by_user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "objective": "Fix my trip after a disruption."
}

### List workflows
GET {{baseUrl}}/internal/workflows
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

